## Proposed Changes

### Configuration

#### [NEW] [summarization_config.yaml](file:///d:/Users/Mihir/Downloads/Documents/Mihir%20Codes/Dp_Project/config/summarization_config.yaml)

BART and FLAN-T5 hyperparameters, integrated with existing [ConfigLoader](file:///d:/Users/Mihir/Downloads/Documents/Mihir%20Codes/Dp_Project/scripts/utils/config_loader.py#6-80):

```yaml
# BART Summarization Config
bart:
  model_name: "facebook/bart-large-cnn"
  max_input_length: 1024
  max_target_length: 256
  min_target_length: 30
  num_beams: 4
  length_penalty: 2.0
  no_repeat_ngram_size: 3
  learning_rate: 2e-5
  batch_size: 2             # Small for 4GB GPU
  gradient_accumulation_steps: 4  # Effective batch = 8
  epochs: 5
  warmup_ratio: 0.1
  weight_decay: 0.01
  fp16: true
  early_stopping_patience: 3
  entity_loss_weight: 1.5   # Extra weight for STEM entities

# FLAN-T5 Config
flan_t5:
  model_name: "google/flan-t5-base"
  max_input_length: 512
  max_target_length: 150
  temperature: 0.7
  top_p: 0.9
  batch_size: 4
  min_quality_score: 0.3    # SBERT similarity threshold

# Data Preparation
data_prep:
  min_segment_words: 50          # Minimum words per topical block
  max_segment_words: 800         # Maximum words per topical block
  visual_tags: ["equation", "diagram", "code", "slide", "graph"]
  summary_review_samples: 20    # Samples saved for manual review
```

